{"_doc":"1:1 element plan for the Wizz/Ryanair BG results reference (ref.png, 1000×532 crop), measured with see.py (GATE 1) and verified by the eye gate (build 364:6465: EYE MATCH 96%). Differs from the 1440 gold on purpose where the reference says so: up chevrons (expanded), Cozy radios (20 px rings), full-range sliders, identical baggage icons on all legs, STN/LTN orange Regular, \"+1\" orange, \"Директен\" grey, tab titles 16 px.","frame":{"w":1000,"h":532,"breakpoint":"crop 1000 (component-level reference — measured size kept)","density":"Cozy","floorplan":"List Report"},"sections":[{"id":"A","name":"Filter sidebar (left column)","describe":"A narrow left column. First a title \"Спирки\" (Stops) with a collapse arrow, under it 4 radio options each with a price under the label: Всички (selected), Директни, До 1 спирка, До 2 спирки. Below that a title \"Часове\" (Hours) with a collapse arrow, under it two labeled range sliders: Заминаване (with two time values above the track) and Връщане (same). Below that a \"Багаж\" (Baggage) title, cut off at the bottom of the frame.","box":[26,25,259,507],"layout":"column FIXED 259 wide, gap 12; each filter = title row + gap 14 + white card (1px sapGroup_ContentBorderColor, r8); titles and chevrons sit outside the cards","sap":["Text (section titles)","Radio Button ×4 (Compact)","Text (price under each)","2 Slider ranges","Text (Baggage title)"]},{"id":"B","name":"Sort tabs (right column, top)","describe":"Three tabs side by side, left to right: \"Най-добро\" (bold, underlined, selected — with a price and duration under it), \"Най-евтино\" (with its own price/duration under it), \"Най-бързо\" (same). Far right, a filter/sort icon.","box":[302,13,680,56],"layout":"row: 3 tabs FIXED 208 (title + price/duration centred) with 1px separators; the selected tab has a 3px indicator under its full width; sort Icon Button centred in the last 49 px","sap":["Icon Tab Bar (or Segmented Button) — 3 tabs","Text ×2 under each tab (price, duration)","Icon Button (sort/filter) far right"]},{"id":"C","name":"Flight result cards (right column, below tabs)","describe":"Two result cards, one under the other, same layout. Each card: a small pin/bookmark icon on the far left. Next to it, two flight legs stacked vertically (outbound, then return), separated by a thin line. Each leg, left to right: airline logo; departure time and airport code (bold); an arrow with the duration and \"Директен\" (direct) under it; arrival time and airport code (bold, orange on the outbound row); a row of 3 small icons (bag, no food, no refund) at the right edge of the leg. Below the two legs, a vertical divider, then on the far right the price in bold pink and an \"Избор\" (Select) primary button. Under each card, a small grey disclaimer line about extra agency fees.","box":[302,81,680,447],"layout":"column gap 12: pink highlight wrapper (r8, padding 0/4/4/4, badges row 32 tall) around card 1, then card 2; each card = [legs 499 | 1px separator | price column] + 1px divider + disclaimer row inside the card","sap":["Icon (pin/bookmark)","flight-leg row ×2 per card (logo, times, route arrow, direct label, 3 fee icons)","divider (vertical)","Text price (LargeText/Bold)","Button Primary (Избор)","Text (disclaimer, small, secondary)"],"recipe":"flight_result_card"}],"rows":[{"section":"A","element":"Stops Filter","kind":"container","border_role":"card_border","fill_role":"card_background","group":"Stops"},{"section":"A","element":"Stops title","kind":"text","text":"Спирки","style":"H5/Bold","role":"title_text"},{"section":"A","element":"Stops collapse icon","kind":"icon","icon":"navigation-up-arrow","meaning":"collapse","role":"icon"},{"section":"A","element":"Radio Всички","kind":"component","component":"Radio Button","props":{"Selected":"True","Form Factor":"Cozy"},"role":"selection_control","group":"stop-all"},{"section":"A","element":"Label Всички","kind":"text","text":"Всички","style":"MediumText/LHAuto/Regular","role":"body_text"